content:
The U2F Tokens by User ID API endpoint /admin/v1/users/[user_id]/u2ftokens
is deprecated as of February 2022. This API no longer allows listing all U2F tokens for a
user. Requests to this endpoint now fail with the following response:
{
"stat": "OK",
"response": ""
}
DELETE  /admin/v1/users/[user_id]/tokens/[token_id]
{
"stat": "OK",
"response": ""
}
